Configure it for your 15-minute process
1. In Automation Studio, keep your existing 15-minute schedule.
2. Configure the SQL activity to populate a sendable entry Data Extension containing only newly eligible leads. For this recurring journey, use Append to add new rows rather than overwriting the entry source.
3. In Journey Builder, select that Data Extension as the entry source.
4. Set the entry source schedule type to Automation, and select your automation.
5. Choose Evaluate new records only. For the first evaluation, choose whether to include all existing records or only records added after activation.
6. Add an Email activity and select the approved Brochure Sharing Email.
7. Set contact re-entry to No re-entry for this one-time brochure campaign, if that matches your campaign policy.
8. Validate the journey with test leads before activating it.
